---
name: "Code Review Evidence"
description: "Reviews the built change and records evidence for approval"
tags: [check, review]
stage: check
---
Read the current issue first:

```bash
mo issue view ${{ issue.number }} --project ${{ issue.projectId }}
```

Read the current issue and the plan artifacts under `PLANS/`. Review the repository diff under `REPOS/${{ repository.name }}` in a separate reviewer role. Check coverage, correctness, consistency, and tests against the issue and plan. Write findings to `PLANS/REVIEW.md` with must-fix findings first and observations separately. This report is evidence for the approver, not a workflow verdict: do not write PASS/FAIL promise markers and do not modify repository files.
